        "y0": 0.07920789960137936,
        "x1": 0.9307388169014084,
        "y1": 0.10307434005067707
      },
      "text": "TALVACE. A kind of buckler or shield, bent on each side, and rising in the middle.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5963367887323944,
        "y0": 0.10736120544551721,
        "x1": 0.824669408450704,
        "y1": 0.11454334204769476
      },
      "text": "Aither broght unto the place",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5971464788732394,
        "y0": 0.11755212798482761,
        "x1": 0.781341269633803,
        "y1": 0.12567360897347088
      },
      "text": "A mikel rowud talvace.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7307453521126759,
        "y0": 0.13201387864689662,
        "x1": 0.9283097464788731,
        "y1": 0.1384749943380298
      },
      "text": "Ytvaine and Gawin, 3158.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5959319436619718,
        "y0": 0.14445313208689656,
        "x1": 0.8623280969014084,
        "y1": 0.16442722699547177
      },
      "text": "And after mete thar it was, The children pleide at the taloas.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7266969014084507,
        "y0": 0.16964186602068976,
        "x1": 0.9274968175774648,
        "y1": 0.1778740977863056
      },
      "text": "Beves of Hamtoun , p. 145.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4967449014084507,
        "y0": 0.17914763071724146,
        "x1": 0.8388365568450704,
        "y1": 0.19065310298201418
      },
      "text": "TALWHE. Tallow. Nominale MS.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49634005633802813,
        "y0": 0.19306051965517246,
        "x1": 0.5473505352112676,
        "y1": 0.20219653319500042
      },
      "text": "TAM.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5708315492957746,
        "y0": 0.1948635762606897,
        "x1": 0.8453246039436618,
        "y1": 0.20355463865276469
      },
      "text": "The abbr. of pr. n. Thomasine.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49634005633802813,
        "y0": 0.2064564874,
        "x1": 0.816175758873239,
        "y1": 0.21720906685626235
      },
      "text": "TAMaRA. a compound of spices.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4971497464788732,
        "y0": 0.22015482715724144,
        "x1": 0.9275000563380281,
        "y1": 0.2439803265760343
      },
      "text": "TAME. (1) To broach or taste hquor. \" To tame, tap, doliutn relinere\" Coles.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.535610028169014,
        "y0": 0.24732199574344835,
        "x1": 0.8481463740845071,
        "y1": 0.2560446747785165
      },
      "text": "Nowe to weete ourmouthes tyme wore,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5352051830985916,
        "y0": 0.2604345872951724,
        "x1": 0.8756806970140842,
        "y1": 0.2682799974095916
      },
      "text": "This flagette will I tame, yf thou reade us.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7683959436619717,
        "y0": 0.27451171350206904,
        "x1": 0.8736508038309859,
        "y1": 0.28024149996299114
      },
      "text": "Chester Plays,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4959352112676056,
        "y0": 0.2843168866055173,
        "x1": 0.761914374084507,
        "y1": 0.2935000165345409
      },
      "text": "(2) To cut ; to divide. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49472067605633796,
        "y0": 0.2968704222248276,
        "x1": 0.9270944015774648,
        "y1": 0.3466629554440503
      },
      "text": "TAME-GOOSE. A foohsh fellow. \" I say cast away ; yea, utterly cast away upon a noddy, a ninny-hammer, a tame-goose,\" The Case h AUered, 4to. Lond. 1605.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.35026979141517245,
        "x1": 0.8258839436619717,
        "y1": 0.3618927364889536
      },
      "text": "TAMER. A team of horses. Norf",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.36373669241379314,
        "x1": 0.8234483957183096,
        "y1": 0.3741778507450251
      },
      "text": "TAMINE. A sort of woollen cloth.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.3775812548813794,
        "x1": 0.8254750501408452,
        "y1": 0.38821372559305517
      },
      "text": "TAMLIN. A miner's tooL Comw.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.3905597110703448,
        "x1": 0.8461302456338027,
        "y1": 0.4013978139486367
      },
      "text": "TAMMY. Glutinous, or sizy. Cumb.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4939109859154929,
        "y0": 0.4043429100537932,
        "x1": 0.724671866366197,
        "y1": 0.4142045840976416
      },
      "text": "TAMPIN. A long pellet.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5165823098591549,
        "y0": 0.41803621465517243,
        "x1": 0.9250717956056335,
        "y1": 0.52143108857162
      },
      "text": "Make two stiffe long rowles or tampins of linncn clowtes, or such like stuffe, sharpe pointed like .suger-loves : which iowipiw* are called of the physitians in Latine pessi, and being annointed with the ointment aforesaid, thrust them up into the horsses nostrils, and let them abide therein a pretty whilk ; then pul them out, and you shal see such abundance of matter come forth at his nose as is marvellous to behold.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.5277088277144828,
        "x1": 0.9246637117746472,
        "y1": 0.5745426687243025
      },
      "text": "Topselfs Four-Footed Beasts, 1C07, p. 372. TAMPING-IRON. A tool\" used for beating down the earthy substance in the charge used for blasting. Comw.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.5781462317779311,
        "x1": 0.923857260394366,
        "y1": 0.6154221886449998
      },
      "text": "TAMPION. A piece of wood fitted to the mouth of a large gun. \" Tampyon for a gon, tampon,\" Palsgrave, subst. f. 69.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5161774647887324,
        "y0": 0.6196135205406897,
        "x1": 0.924262915154929,
        "y1": 0.6627892545389551
      },
      "text": "Unadvisedly gave fire to a peece charged with a pellet insteede of a tampion, the which lighting on the palaice wall, ranne through one of the privie lodgings, and did no further harmo.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.6675071301627588,
        "x1": 0.9226419154929577,
        "y1": 0.6877841170001645
      },
      "text": "Lambardes Perambulation, 15f)fi, p. 433. TAN. (1) Taken. (A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.551398985915493,
        "y0": 0.6914409555710346,
        "x1": 0.8238629570704225,
        "y1": 0.7002365588794519
      },
      "text": "When pese was cryed and day tan,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5522086760563379,
        "y0": 0.7038001520151724,
        "x1": 0.8129289014084505,
        "y1": 0.7126245187846061
      },
      "text": "Kyng Ardus was a yoyfulle man.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7084788732394365,
        "y0": 0.7165921785848276,
        "x1": 0.9230427121126761,
        "y1": 0.725191014802638
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f.78.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5716412394366197,
        "y0": 0.7304909631393104,
        "x1": 0.8238556698591547,
        "y1": 0.738463087610927
      },
      "text": "Baptem the first is holden than,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5716412394366197,
        "y0": 0.7424240248275863,
        "x1": 0.7845897464788733,
        "y1": 0.7504499646587358
      },
      "text": "That falleth at the fonte be tan.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7554409014084507,
        "y0": 0.7554956958262069,
        "x1": 0.923858070084507,
        "y1": 0.7633744416531989
      },
      "text": "MS. Sloan. 1785, f. 34.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "heading",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935061408450704,
        "y0": 0.7685046107434483,
        "x1": 0.7016029845633802,
        "y1": 0.7777072060380462
      },
      "text": "(2; To entice. (A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": 1,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5716412394366197,
        "y0": 0.7815460906303449,
        "x1": 0.8181902679436617,
        "y1": 0.7892182671285368
      },
      "text": "Thefende of helleagayn skylle",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5720460845070422,
        "y0": 0.7935473895834483,
        "x1": 0.8133337464788732,
        "y1": 0.8487046867871784
      },
      "text": "Put in hir a harde wille Hur fadur luf to wynne ; And also temped was that man His owne doujter for to tan. To do a dedly synne.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7100982535211267,
        "y0": 0.8537915724496552,
        "x1": 0.9250726052957747,
        "y1": 0.8619536901363258
      },
      "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. v, 48, f. 43.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.8663831542220689,
        "x1": 0.6890463098591546,
        "y1": 0.8753182234310927
      },
      "text": "(3) Then. Far. dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4939109859154929,
        "y0": 0.8793851061531035,
        "x1": 0.8368188090140845,
        "y1": 0.8882229301759772
      },
      "text": "(4) To dun. (5) To beat. Var. dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.8912563583296552,
        "x1": 0.8133377949295773,
        "y1": 0.901603757762184
      },
      "text": "(6) A twig, or small switch. Lane.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935061408450704,
        "y0": 0.9047765348455172,
        "x1": 0.925880676056338,
        "y1": 0.9547054770966504
      },
      "text": "TANACLES. A kind of pincers, used formerly for torturing. \"To pinch or tanacle with tongs, with pincers or tanacles,\" Florio, p. 552, ed. 1611.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8825622535211267,
        "y0": 0.2753554490193104,
        "x1": 0.9266936049577463,
        "y1": 0.28043159216134417
      },
      "text": "i. 124.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
